gBF(){return"Wood Wave Panel"},
gBE(){return"Wood wave panel is a modern decorative material that combines the natural beauty of wood with the durability of plastic. The product features a unique wave pattern that creates an elegant and modern look, suitable for both interior and exterior applications."},
